Fakebook CSAE Policy

At Fakebook, we are committed to creating a safe and respectful online environment for all users. We have zero tolerance for child sexual abuse and exploitation (CSAE) on our platform.

Our policy includes:

    Immediate removal of any content involving or promoting CSAE

    Permanent banning of any accounts found violating this policy

    Reporting of all CSAE content to appropriate law enforcement and child protection organizations (such as NCMEC)

    Use of tools and moderation practices to detect and prevent CSAE content from being uploaded or shared

If you encounter any content or behavior related to child sexual abuse or exploitation, please report it immediately using our in-app tools or by contacting us at [your contact email].

We take these issues seriously and will cooperate fully with law enforcement authorities where required.
